<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.hold.releases ~ one held document id, released over the stopped store

`lares vessel release <documentId>` ends one quarantine hold while no holder answers for the store: bare the held bytes return; `--keep` keeps what stands under the id; `--fresh` starts a plane no sibling carries empty. A holder or a fallen vessel over the store refuses, naming the stop that frees it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ restore · keep

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`restore` params=`document/<documentId> ~ return the held bytes`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`keep` params=`document/<documentId> keep/true ~ keep what stands`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ document · keep · fresh · root

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`document` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/1 as/<documentId> ~ the held document id, as lares vessel read lists it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`keep` params=`~ keep what stands under the id`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`fresh` params=`~ start the id empty`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`root` params=`takes/dir ~ the vessel root (LAR_ROOT) this call reads`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand ~ writes the stopped store; a person's act`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · one-act · store-held · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.hold.releases document/<documentId>]] ~ name one document id`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`one-act` params=`~ --keep and --fresh name two acts; name one`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`store-held` params=`~ a holder answers for the store; lares vessel stop first`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`refused` params=`~ the release refused; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ released · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`released` params=`exit/0 ~ the hold ended`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

